  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-sports",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sports_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「生徒会の威信に関わります。けれど、わたしなら安心でしょう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-sports",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sports_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「勝利までは求めません。あくまでイレギュラーな案件です、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-sports",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sports_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「選手が足りなくて進行がストップしているのですよ。どうも教師は、そういうトラブルの処理に不慣れなようで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「我々も静観せず、サポートすべきでしょう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-sports",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sports_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「恙なく行事を進行するのが、生徒会の務めでもありますからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-sports",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sports_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「問題ないようでしたら、押っ取り刀で参りましょう♪」"
  },
  {
